Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:05.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Worst Renaissance fair ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:05.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史上最糟的文艺复兴博览会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please let it go, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再说了 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: It was rife with historical inaccuracies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到处充斥历史的误谬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:14.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For example, the tavern girl serving flagons of mead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:14.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}举例来说 酒馆女服务生 用大酒壶装蜂蜜酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, her costume was obviously Germanic...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的衣服却明显是日耳曼风格的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:20.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but in 1487, the Bavarian purity laws, or Reinheitsgebot...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:20.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过在1487年 巴伐利亚纯净酿酒法或纯粹令
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:23.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...severely limited the availability of mead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:23.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是严格限制供应蜂蜜酒的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:25.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At best, they would've had some spiced wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:25.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最多只能卖加了香料的葡萄酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: You're nitpicking. SHELDON: Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在鸡蛋里挑骨头 -真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, here's another nit for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再挑个骨头给你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:33.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The flagons would not have been made of polypropylene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:33.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大酒壶不是用聚丙烯做的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Renaissance fairs aren't about historical accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}文艺复兴博览会和历史准确性无关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're about taking chubby girls who work at Kinko's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是要让在复印店工作的胖女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and lacing them up in corsets so tight...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把束腹勒得紧紧的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...their bosom jumps out and says, "Howdy."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让她们的胸部跳出来说“你好”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:48.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bosoms would not have said, "Howdy," in the 15th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:48.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}15世纪的胸部不会说“你好”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If anything, they would've said, "Huzzah."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是会说话 他们会说“好啊”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care what the bosoms say, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不管胸部会说什么 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanna be part of the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在跟你抬杠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Looks like you've been to the Renaissance fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来你们去了文艺复兴博览会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:03.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Renaissance fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:03.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}文艺复兴博览会？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More of a medieval-slash- Age of Enlightenment...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比较像是中世纪兼启蒙时代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:09.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...slash- any-excuse-to-wear-a-codpiece fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:09.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}兼找借口穿遮阴布的博览会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fine, whatever. Um, you guys, this is my friend Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 随便 各位 这是我朋友 艾利克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello. ERIC: Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, yeah, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Yeah, it's good to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我也很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We should probably go. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们该走了 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:29.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye, guys. -Like your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:29.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见了 -我喜欢你的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, my mom made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 我妈做的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:38.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny with a new guy. Très awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:38.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮找到新男人 尴尬透顶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:41.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:41.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:45.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't fun. Besides, what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:45.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不好玩 再说了 那有什么了不起？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:48.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We dated, we stopped dating, and now we're both moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:48.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们约会过 没再约会了 现在都往前看了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By "moving on," you mean she's going out with other men...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你指的往前看 是指她和其他男人约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:56.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you spend the afternoon making 15th-century soap with Wolowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:56.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你花一个下午 和沃洛维茨做15世纪的肥皂？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was not 15th-century soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是15世纪的肥皂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:01.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My god, those people need to learn you can't just put "ye olde"...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:01.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的老天 那些人得学学 你不能什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in front of anything you want and expect to get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都冠个“古董”就想蒙混过关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:08.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we please just go in? My chain mail's stuck in my underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:08.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以进去了吗？ 我的锁子甲黏在内裤上了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're wearing modern underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还穿着现代内裤？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:14.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Relatively modern.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:14.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相对现代的内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:16.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:16.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你穿什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I fashioned historically accurate undergarments out of linen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我精确地遵照历史 穿亚麻内衣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:22.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You went and bought linen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:22.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去买了亚麻布？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be silly. I borrowed one of your pillowcases.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别傻了 我借你的枕套做的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:30.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Borrowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:30.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}借？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I'm happy that Penny's moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很高兴佩妮往前走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It gives me freedom to move on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也给我往前走的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:03:00.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you saying that you've been holding back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:03:00.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说你一直没放开？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course. Out of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 出于尊敬
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:07.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how do you explain the 10 years before Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:07.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你怎么解释遇见佩妮前的十年？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who were you respecting then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当时在尊敬谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I've dated plenty of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？我和很多女人约会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was, uh, Joyce Kim, Leslie Winkle....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有乔伊丝金、莱斯丽温克尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Notify the editors of the Oxford English Dictionary:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通知《牛津英语字典》的编辑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The word "plenty" has been redefined to mean "two."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“多”这个字要重新定义成“两个”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about that girl last year at Comic-Con?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那去年动漫展那个女生呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It doesn't count. -Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那不算 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:35.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happens in costume at Comic-Con stays at Comic-Con.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:35.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}穿着戏服在动漫展发生的事 就留在动漫展
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're only saying that because of what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会这么说只是因为 发生在你身上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What happened to you? -Nothing happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你发生了什么事？ -我没发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't your fault, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 这不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was dressed as a green Orion slave girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他打扮成奥利安的女仆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did we get on me? We were mocking Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么扯到我头上？ 我们在嘲笑莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dude, you have totally not moved on. -Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-老兄 你完全没有往前走 -是的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just a matter of actually making a date with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只不过是要找个人约会而己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:04:00.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Like who? -Well, there's Joyce Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:04:00.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-像是谁？ -有乔伊丝金
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she defected back to North Korea...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她逃回朝鲜了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so it's a little geographically undesirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我不喜欢远距离恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What about Leslie Winkle? -Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那莱斯丽温克尔呢？ -不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Her research methodology is sloppy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -她的研究方法很马虎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:16.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she's unjustifiably arrogant about loop quantum gravity...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:16.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在回圈量子重力论上 又不可理喻地自大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and to make matters worse, she's often mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更糟的是 她常常对我很刻薄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:22.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I think she's smoking hot. -I'd hit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:22.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我觉得她很性感 -我承认
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:27.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd hit particulate soil in a colloidal suspension.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:27.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是同意胶状悬浮物里的土壤微粒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是泥土
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:34.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I like Leslie, but she's not interested in dating...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:34.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我喜欢莱斯丽 但她没兴趣谈恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as much as using men as tools for stress release.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比较是把男人当成释放压力的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah? So? Be a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？又怎样？就当个工具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go get yourself a little rebound stress release.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让自己感受释放压力的波动反应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It would only be rebound if he and Penny had actually engaged in physical intimacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}技术上来说 如果他和佩妮真的进行 身体的亲密行为才会有波动反应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean like you and Richard the slave girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说你和那个女仆理察？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bought him dinner and we kissed once. That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我请他吃晚餐 亲了一次嘴 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he told me his name was Kimberly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟我说他的名字叫金柏利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how I know we're not in the Matrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我怎么知道 我们不在矩阵里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we were, the food would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果是的话 食物会好吃点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:18.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:18.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leslie. -Hey, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱斯丽 你好 -笨蛋你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:25.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello to you, insufficiently intelligent person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 智能不足的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, rush me to the Burn Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赶紧送我去烫伤中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have a second? I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有空吗？我要问你一些事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, sure. -Well, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有 当然 -容我失陪…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:39.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm going to go do work that promises significant results...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:39.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去做保证有重大结果的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:44.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as opposed to what you do, which does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:44.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}与你毫无成果的工作正好相反
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:00.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:04.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I heard your relationship with Penny crashed to the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:04.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听说你和佩妮的关系发生意外了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...like blue ice falling out of an airplane lavatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像蓝冰掉出飞机厕所一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:12.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where'd you hear that? -Actually, I read it. Wolowitz texted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:12.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你从哪听到的？ -事实上是沃洛维茨发短信说的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Like blue ice falling out of an airplane lavatory," yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“就像蓝冰掉出飞机厕所一样” 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I thought it was a pretty good one. I gave him an "LOL."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得很好笑 还回了个笑脸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, it got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正 这让我考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:26.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now that you're unattached, maybe we can revisit our previous attachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:26.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然你又恢复单身了 或许我们可以再恢复过去的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:29.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you suggesting another bout of stress release?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:29.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说再释放一次压力？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm all done with casual sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不想再随便上床
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fully committed to the traditional relationship paradigm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我要完全忠于传统的交往模式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's just a time in every woman's life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个女人一生中总有段时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when she gets tired of waking up on a futon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会厌倦在床上醒来时…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a bunch of people she doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身边都是一群不认识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I can see how that would-- A bunch of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我能了解…一群人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I just figure it's time to slow things down...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正 我想 是该放慢脚步了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:53.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and who better to slow things down with than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:53.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你是放慢脚步的最佳人选
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我受宠若惊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how do you suggest we proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你建议我们要怎么进行？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:03.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your place. We'll order Chinese. You'll rent a movie, artsy but accessible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:03.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你家 我们点中国菜 租部艺术电影 但要能看得懂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then light petting, no coitus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后亲吻抚摸 不要性交
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sounds fun. -I'll leave the details up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听起来很好玩 -细节由你来定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's better if you assume the male role.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为由你扮演男性角色比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, that's very thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 真是设想周到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.16,0:07:30.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, great news. My mom sent me my old Nintendo 64.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.16,0:07:31.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好消息 我妈把我以前的任天堂64 寄给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Terrific. -You know what this means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太棒了 -你知道这意味着什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Break out the Red Bull. It's time to rock "Mario" old school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和红牛分手吧 是时候玩玩老派的超级马里奥了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I kind of have other plans tonight. -But it's Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我晚上还有其他计划 -不过今天是周五
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friday's always vintage-game night. Look, Mom included the memory card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周五一直是古董游戏夜 噢 妈还寄了内存卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:52.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can pick up right where I left off in 1999 when I had pernicious anemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以继续从1999年 我得恶性贫血那关开始
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The thing is, someone's coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题是有人要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:58.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, no problem. I have three controllers. The more the merrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:58.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题 我有三个控制器 人多才好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:01.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, it's a date. I have a date coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:01.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 是约会 我约了人过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you can't blame me for not jumping to that conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能怪我没直接跳到结论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:10.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? What's so unusual about me having a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:10.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？我要约会有什么奇怪的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, statistically speaking-- -All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-统计上来说… -好…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nevertheless, I have one now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正我现在有了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'd appreciate it if you would, you know, make yourself scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你可以消失一下 我会感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am a published theoretical physicist with two doctorates...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是拿了两个博士学位 发表过理论的物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and an IQ which can't be measured by normal tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:24.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的智商不能用一般测验评量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much scarcer could I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么珍贵怎么可以消失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:30.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I mean. Could you just give us a little privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:30.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我的意思 可以给我们一点私人空间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:33.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You want me to leave the apartment? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:33.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要我离开公寓？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean just go someplace else and be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说去别的地方 然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...someplace else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -But why should I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -我为什么要离开？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This is my apartment too. -I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这也是我的公寓 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:44.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If science ever discovers a second member of your species...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:44.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果科学找到第二个 像你这样的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you two would like some privacy, I'd be happy to get out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你们两个想独处 我会乐意离开的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:05.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Playing "Super Mario" on a poorly coded Nintendo 64 emulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:05.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用烂任天堂64模拟器 打超级马里奥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But why are you doing it on the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你为什么在楼梯间打？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am a modern-day Napoleon exiled to the Elba of the staircase...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是现代版的拿破仑 被驱逐到楼梯版的厄尔巴岛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because Leonard, get this, has a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为莱纳德 注意听了 在约会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Oh, well, good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦 那很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but why are you sitting here? Why don't you go to a movie or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你为什么坐在这里？ 为什么不去看电影什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, why not? -What if I choke on my popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 有何不可？ -要是我被爆米花噎到呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who will administer the Heimlich maneuver?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁帮我做海姆利克氏操作法？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:32.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Then don't order popcorn. -No popcorn at the mov--?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:32.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那就别点爆米花 -看电影不吃爆米花？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:33.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:33.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听听你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why don't you go to a coffee shop? -I don't drink coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那你为什么不去咖啡店？ -我不喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They have other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们还有其他东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do they have? -I don't know. You know, cookies, pastries--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:43.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有什么？ -不知道 饼干、酥皮派
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Pastries such as bear claws? -Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-像熊掌派之类的？ -对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't like bear claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢熊掌派
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:53.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Penny. Dumb-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:53.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie Winkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽温克尔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of all the overrated physicists in all the labs in all the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全世界实验室里那么多物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:03.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why does it have to be Leslie Winkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:03.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么偏偏是莱斯丽温克尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, they have a lot in common. I mean, they're both scientists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们有很多共通点 他们都是科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:09.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please. The only way she could make a contribution to science...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:09.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 她要是能对科学产生贡献…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would be if they resumed sending chimps into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是他们继续送猩猩上太空的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, I have a date too, so I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我也有约会 所以再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:21.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody has a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:21.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个人都有约会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even you, Mario, going after Princess Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马里奥 连你都去找桃子公主
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:29.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what am I doing? I'm just enabling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:29.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我呢？只能操纵你而己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:35.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This is pretty good orange chicken. -Yeah, it's from Chang's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:35.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这个陈皮鸡很好吃 -对 是陈记的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Not Chow's? -No, Chang's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不是周记？ -不 是陈记
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What happened to Chow's? -It changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那周记呢？ -改名了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how many children do you think we should have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:46.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[COUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:46.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认为我们要生几个孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:49.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, that was a little abrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:49.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 这有点唐突
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are so many things to talk about before reproduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们讨论繁殖前 还有很多可以讨论的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然也这么希望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Besides shortness, what genetic weaknesses run in your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了矮小 你们家还有什么基因缺陷？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry to interrupt. Battery's dying. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉打扰了 电池没电了 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:11.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, genetic weaknesses, right. Um, there's the lactose intolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:11.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基因缺陷 好 有乳糖不耐症
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:14.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't forget the male-pattern baldness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:14.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了雄性秃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When his uncles sit around the dinner table, they look like a half-carton of eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的叔叔们坐在餐桌旁时 看起来就像半盒蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, yeah, my uncles are bald...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我叔叔是秃头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but my Aunt Edna is one of the hairiest women you'll ever meet, so, you know....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但爱达娜阿姨的头发 会是你见过最多的 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweet lady. It always tickles when she hugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很和蔼的太太 每次她抱我的时候我都会发痒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:56.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What now? -I have to make pee-pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:56.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-又怎么了？ -我要尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:04.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry about all of Sheldon's interruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:04.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为谢尔顿打扰的事道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He can be a bit of an eccentric.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是有点古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If by "eccentric"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你说“古怪”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you mean "passive-aggressive East Texas blowhole," I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是指“东德州扯后腿的大嘴巴” 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:14.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I think tonight was a very good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:14.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想今晚是非常好的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too. You're sure you're okay postponing intercourse...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也这么认为 你真的可以 延后性交时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:20.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...until our relationship is past the initial viability test?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:20.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到我们的关系通过 初期可行性测试？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:24.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No problem. I'm very skilled at postponing intercourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:24.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然了 我很擅于延后性交期
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I'll call you and we'll arrange another evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再打给你约下次的见面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe protocol dictates that you wait a minimum of 18 hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们的规则是 你至少等18个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:35.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before you call so I'm not repulsed by your cloying eagerness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:35.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再打来 这样我才不会讨厌你的猴急
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sure. -Again, it's your decision. You're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好的 -不过决定权在你 你是男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: No, it wasn't my cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那不是我的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:44.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was an experiment designed by this guy named Schrödinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:44.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是薛定谔设计的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From the Charlie Brown cartoons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《查理布朗》卡通里的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:52.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he was some kind of scientist. Let me start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:52.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 他是科学家 我再重说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, Leonard. -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:56.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leslie. LESLIE: Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:56.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱斯丽 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那么 晚安了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那么 晚安了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:12.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That ain't gonna make your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:12.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样子不够
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…够了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:34.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:36.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那么 晚安了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, okay, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:38.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Had a great time. Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -我玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:44.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I am not going back to the Renaissance fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:44.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我不要再去 文艺复兴博览会了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:45.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:45.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are so few places I can wear my jester costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没几个地方可以让我穿小丑装
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. There are far too many historical anomalies for my comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不管 那里太多历史误谬 让我觉得不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那这样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:59.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can go dressed as a Star Trek science officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:59.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以穿着《星际迷航》里 科学家的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:03.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...exploring a planet similar to Earth in the 1500s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:03.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}探索和16世纪地球相似的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:04.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean like Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:04.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说像斯波克？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, fellow scientists. Sheldon. LEONARD: Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位科学家 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:19.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we move there so Leslie can join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:19.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不换到那桌 莱斯丽就能一起坐了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're having trouble deciding where to sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你决定不了要坐哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I suggest One Potato, Two Potato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我建议你念个顺口溜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or as I call it, the Leslie Winkle Experimental Methodology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是照我说的 用莱斯丽温克尔实验法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Don't make this hard for me. -It's not hard. It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-别让我为难 -不难 很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:43.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can either sit with me, your friend, colleague and roommate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:43.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以和我坐 我是你的朋友、同事、室友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:47.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or you can sit with an overrated scientist you might have sex with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:47.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或去找你可能和她上床 那个被高估的科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, it is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对 很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Sheldon. SHELDON: Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:01.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Third floor tonight. Mixing it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:01.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚坐三楼啊 吵架了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still don't understand why you don't just go to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是不懂你为什么不去吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, let's say I go to dinner alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 要是我一个人去吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and during the meal I have to use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在吃饭时我要去上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do I know someone's not touching my food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么知道别人不会碰我的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You sure things can't work out with you and Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定你和莱纳德合不来？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:27.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:27.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just wondering if you really gave it the old college try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在想你能不能 再给老同事一次机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:35.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or in your case, the old community-college try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:35.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是依你来说 给老社区大学一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, where is this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:43.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard is upstairs right now with my archenemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:43.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在莱纳德和我的大敌在楼上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Your archenemy? -Yes, the Dr. Doom to my Mr. Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的大敌 -对 末日博士对抗我的神奇先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Dr. Octopus to my Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八爪博士对抗我的蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The Dr. Sivana to my Captain Marvel-- -Okay, I get it, I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-斯瓦纳博士对抗我的惊奇队长 -好 我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:57.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's amazing how many super villains have advanced degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:57.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真奇怪 这么多恶棍都有很高的学位
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Graduate schools should do a better job of screening those people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}研究院应该做好筛选的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, come back. You're losing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 回来 你扯远了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:08.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Leslie Winkle, Penny. She belittles my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:08.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我说的是莱斯丽温克尔 她轻视我的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweetie, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:12.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She called me "dumb-ass."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:12.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫我“蠢蛋”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:14.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Given the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I have no choice but to withdraw my previous objections...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不得不收回之前反对…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:22.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to your ill-considered relationship with Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:22.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和莱纳德欠缺考虑的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gee, well, thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, um, I think for now Leonard and I are just gonna stay friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我想现在莱纳德和我 还是当朋友就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. That response is unacceptable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:32.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不能接受那种回答
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:36.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You are a smart guy. You must know-- -I'm smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:36.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是个聪明人 你一定知道… -我聪明？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd have to lose 60 IQ points to be classified as "smart."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我智商得少60分才能算聪明人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you gonna let me talk? -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要让我说话吗？ -对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:47.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You must know that if Leonard and Leslie wanna be together...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:47.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定知道要是莱纳德 和莱斯丽想交往
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...nothing you can do is gonna stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你根本无法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:53.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You continue to underestimate my capabilities, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:53.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你继续低估我的能力吧 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:57.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let me put it this way. If you're Leonard's friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:57.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这样说好了 如果你是莱纳德的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:17:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you will support him no matter who he wants to be with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:17:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该支持他 不管他要和谁交往
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. Why am I doing all the giving here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:04.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 我为什么要在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If Leonard's really my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果莱纳德真的是我朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why doesn't he have to support me in my hatred of Leslie Winkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他为什么不支持我 去讨厌莱斯丽温克尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because love trumps hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为爱超越怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, now you're just making stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这是现编的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Good night, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 晚安 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢 超级马里奥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:27.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If only I could control everyone the way I control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:27.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果控制别人能像控制你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hop, you little plumber, hop, hop, hop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跳 你这小水管工 跳…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:41.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When the two of you reach a natural stopping point, I'd like to have a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:41.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等两位到达自然停顿点时 我想说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:45.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If the word is "pee-pee," just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:45.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果这话是“尿尿”就请便
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:51.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you're my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:51.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and friends support their friends, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朋友显然该互相支持
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I am withdrawing my objection...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我不再反对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:18:00.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to your desire to have a relationship with Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:18:00.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想和莱斯丽谈恋爱的欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -I will graciously overlook the fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 -我会优雅地忽略…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that she is an arrogant, subpar scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是个傲慢、低水准的科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who believes loop quantum gravity better unites quantum mechanics...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只相信回圈量子重力比弦论更能…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with general relativity than does string theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结合量子力学和广义相对论
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:15.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You kids have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:15.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Loop quantum gravity clearly offers more testable predictions than string theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回圈量子重力显然比弦论 提供更多可验证的预测
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm listening. Amuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在听 说来笑一笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:27.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, for one thing, we expect quantized space-time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:27.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 一方面 我们预期量子化的时空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:31.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to manifest as minute differences in the speed of light for different colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:31.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能证明光速下不同颜色的微小差异
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:35.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Balderdash. Matter clearly consists of tiny strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:35.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}胡说 物质明显是由微小的弦组成的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you gonna let him talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要让他那样说我？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, there is a lot of merit to both theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 两个理论都有很多优点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, there isn't. Only loop quantum gravity calculates the entropy of black holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 没有 只有回圈量子重力 能计算黑洞的熵值
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.05,0:18:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SNORTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, don't make that noise. It's disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:57.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 别发出那种声音 很没有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:19:00.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should hope so. It was a snort of derision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:19:00.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我故意的 那是嗤之以鼻的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You agree with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你同意我 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:05.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Loop quantum gravity is the future of physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:05.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回圈量子重力论是物理学的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:09.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, Leslie, I guess I prefer my space stringy, not loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:09.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 莱斯丽 我比较喜欢弦论 不是回圈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm glad I found out the truth about you before this went any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很高兴在进一步发展前 先发现这个事实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Truth? What truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实？什么事实？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're talking about untested hypotheses-- Look, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们讨论的是未经证明的假设 这又没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:20.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it isn't? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:20.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么吗？真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:22.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me, Leonard, how will we raise the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:22.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我 莱纳德 我们要怎么教育孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess we wait until they're old enough and let them choose their own theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想等他们够大时 让他们自己选择理论
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't let them choose, Leonard, they're children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能让他们选 莱纳德 他们只是孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:42.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could've accepted our kids being genetically unable to eat ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:42.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以接受我们的孩子 因基因问题无法吃冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or ever get a good view of a parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是不能好好看游行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:49.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But this? This is a deal breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:49.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过这个？这我无法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}往好的方面看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the bright side? -Only nine more months to Comic-Con.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么好的方面？ -再过九个月就是动漫展了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHIRRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Captain, I'm getting an unusual reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}舰长 我收到异常指数
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's great. You guys want corn dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 你们要不要吃热狗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a temporal anomaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又是时间异常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Corn dogs didn't come into existence till the first half of the 20th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}热狗直到20世纪前半段才会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 郑伟
